    "data": {
      "text": "[](https://travis-ci.org/NLESC-JCER/Fortran_Davidson) [](https://github.com/NLESC-JCER/Fortran_Davidson/actions) [](https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.3637964)\n\nDavidson Eigensolver\n\nThis package contains a Modern Fortran implementation of the Davidson diagonalization algorithms. Different schemas are available to compute the correction.\n\nAvailable correction methods are:  DPR: Diagonal-Preconditioned-Residue  GJD: Generalized Jacobi Davidson",
